                                                "text": "Holonyms: calendar year; year"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "d2b4fec0-543a-472c-82f0-dcdc489988d7",
                                                "sense_id": "ca5d2975-c99c-3614-9ee2-161ef5f138a5",
                                                "text": "From July 2025, the income assessment method for young couples buying BTO flats will be tweaked."
